I love it.

32
00:02:12.864 --> 00:02:14.071
I love you.

33
00:02:22.374 --> 00:02:24.206
- I'm still...
- Are you filming? Oh, my God! (LAUGHING)

34
00:02:24.293 --> 00:02:25.750
Yeah, I'm still recording.
I'm trying to get this.

35
00:02:25.836 --> 00:02:27.623
Come on, Mitch!

36
